  "story": {
    "text": "Everyone {PANICS}. Wentworth kneels by Louisa in {DESPAIR}: “Oh God! her father and mother!” Only Anne keeps her head. “A {SURGEON}!” she cries, and Benwick runs. They carry Louisa to the Harvilles’, where she must {REST} for weeks. Wentworth says no one is so {CAPABLE} as Anne, and Anne {TREASURES} it.",
